\item Rastislav Draho\v{s}: using independent DMRG code, exact Bethe ansatz calculations, and boundary CFT theoretical analysis, independently verified every core discovery. He contributed four critical technical corrections (detailed in Sec.~\ref{sec:drahos} and Sec.~VI B).
\item Marat Sultanov: using the TAT-Defense structural diagnostic framework, performed cross-framework blind tests on all experimental data. He contributed the ``honest silence'' principle---a diagnostic tool should actively reject spurious signals when data are insufficient---and independently demonstrated it four times in this collaboration (detailed in Sec.~VI C).
